From c5c29c8e7e9c2a4f53dd2d59b7d8ca14d5c3dbdf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SyzAster Authors <syzaster@asterinas.org>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 10:54:44 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] kcov: implement per-task kernel PC coverage (/dev/kcov)
 and /proc/kallsyms

Add KCOV=1 build instrumentation for aster_core via sancov-module,
implement task-scoped /dev/kcov character device with shared VMO mmap
and KCOV_INIT_TRACE/KCOV_ENABLE/KCOV_DISABLE ioctls, expose _stext and
_etext via /proc/kallsyms, and add KCOV smoke and instrumentation tests.
